f Oct 12, on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 7 grids, January to February and September to October each came in under 90% of normal in 34 of 75 years since 1951. In 2025, the middle of the grids got 47% of normal in November to December and 68% in October to November. So far in 2026, March to April came in at 60% of normal on the middle of the grids. Grid 19389 had its driest year in 2007 at 61% of normal.</p>"}
